# The self-contained classifier package ships its own copies of the model /
# norm stats / label config -- Furqan needs those to use the package from a
# fresh clone, so they're re-included despite the blanket rules above.
!legraise_classifier/
!legraise_classifier/**

# ...except its own generated bytecode cache, which the blanket re-include
# above would otherwise pull back in.
legraise_classifier/__pycache__/
